{"id": "85960", "name": "CR-Diff-06-chain-3.e", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Find the following derivative:\n\\[ \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:1}}]. \\]\n\n[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]\n", "generalfeedback": "In order to solve this problem we will have to use the chain rule <hint>calc_chain_rule</hint> as follows:\n\nDefine \\(f({{CT:0}}):={{CT:1}}\\) and \\(g({{CT:0}}):={{CT:2}}\\).\n\nThen \\(f({{CT:0}})=sin[g({{CT:0}})]\\). So,\n\n\\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle\n  \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:1}}] &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  \\frac{df}{dg}\\cdot \\frac{dg}{d{{CT:0}}} \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  \\frac{d}{dg}[sin(g)]\\cdot \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:2}}] \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:3}}\\cdot \\frac{{CT:4}}{{{CT:4}} {{CT:0}}} \\\\\n   &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:5}}\n \\end{array}\\] ", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "w1:log(v);\nw2:sin(w1);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-diff(p,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "Your answer is the negative of what it should be. The derivative of \\(sin(x)\\) is \\(cos(x)\\), not \\(-cos(x)\\)."}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(w2,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "You appear to have forgotten the {{CT:6}} factor in the \\(ln\\) function."}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp", "rdm", "v"], "nvariants": 5}